{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2c4e49b5-a3ec-521a-adea-bf909ec3091c", "source_ordinal": 954, "reading_ordinal": 3103, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "怒者不医", "published_at": "2025-02-13T03:58:41.077000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/6f6cb4e8e97411ef92025254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然有必要。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "寻求治疗，有一个最基本的原则，那就是要在受控制的过程中进行。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除非没有选择，否则所有的治疗过程、治疗手段、治疗者，都要是稳定的力量，而不能是不稳定的力量。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不能说治疗的某一步是“摇一下骰子，结果说不清，出了结果再说”。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果有，那么这一步也一定不能叫医治。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "可以有某一步有某种程度的暴烈、结果可以有一定程度的不同可能性，但所有预期的结果，必须是先在冷静的状态下心平气和的算过风险和收益，再做好心理准备、有计划的实施的。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "例如要拔一只箭，拔了没准大出血，但是一直不拔死定了，医患双方商量好，合同都签好、毛巾都咬好、止血绷带都准备好，再倒数一二三呀呀嗨，拔了赌一赌。这一拔虽然引入了一定的不稳定性、不确定性，但这是计划良好、管控有效的不确定性。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你仔细看所有的医疗细节——安静的医院、专业的医生护士、禁止随意探视的制度、成分确定的药物、效果得到大量临床实验检验的疗法……所有的一切，都是为了向病患提供和注入确定性，以便排除疾病、伤患带来的不确定性。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“注入确定性”就是治疗的基本原理和基本法则，所以任何引入不确定性的行为都不能被视为一种治疗。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因此，吵架——尤其是情绪驱动的口不择言的吵架——是原则性的不能被接受为一种治疗。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "注意，这不是在说过错一定在医生、护士身上——谁是谁非谁能料——但无论如何，会引发这种激烈的不确定性风暴的要素对你一定不是治愈性的要素。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "从寻求治疗的角度来说，你得寻找自身情绪稳定、做事稳妥可靠，你能与之平和、理性的对话的人来提供治疗。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "为什么要说这么多看似废话的话？", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为醉翁之意不在酒——这里是要提醒父母们，当你们情绪失控时，不论你的理由有多情有可原、动机有多么正当，只要你是在引入一个你自己未加计划和预料的过程，你都不能将这个做法认定为是一种治愈。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这不是在否定你的动机可能是爱，也不是在否定这有可能造成好的变化——有时候猛踢一脚破车反而可能打着火——只是在告诫你们，绝不能将这种做法视为一种“治疗手段”。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 823}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为它确实原理性的不能被这样定性。", "char_start": 824, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而且无论上一次这么做有多么好的净效果，你也要意识到那是运气，是错误的行为遇上了好运气，这不能改变这个行为是极为危险、而且是对危机状况的一次威胁。", "char_start": 842, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你不能从这里面吸取经验，即使有什么好结果以后也尽量避免。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所有的治疗都必须在主观上是追求稳定、受控的，主观上背叛了这一原则的行为，不能被称为治疗、照顾。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 991}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "就是这样。", "char_start": 992, "char_end": 997}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：第一次找男咨询师，咨询时有愤怒有争吵，该不该换一个？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“怒者不医”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然有必要。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然有必要。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "931ccf74-9aa7-53cd-a80b-d10e3c4a4cbe", "source_ordinal": 953, "reading_ordinal": 3104, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "骷髅剑", "published_at": "2025-02-13T17:04:34.712000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/9d95dedee9de11efb02952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "冷漠自私也是人应对问题的一种手段，一种摆在桌面上唾手可得、有一定效果的手段。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "既然如此，就不能不考虑到人会在人生的某个阶段会拿起这件工具来试试，尤其是在那些觉得其他手段已经穷尽、但人生困境感却在不断增强的阶段。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "尽管那些工具贴着骷髅头标签，但是其它的工具都已经用尽了，情况未见好转，人怎么能忍住不用一用这些工具呢？", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "再看一遍，看清楚这三个前提：", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "A）其他工具ta觉得已经用尽。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "B）处在痛苦的危机状态。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "C）该状态仍在恶化。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“责备ta冷漠自私”对这三个认定有何影响？", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "责备并没有提示ta任何老工具的新用法。因此在A项上无贡献。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "责备本身就是“你现在很糟糕”的危机信号，因此在B项上会带来更深的负面影响。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "责备是在ta已经自认三个条件已满足、拿起骷髅剑之后发生，是在原本的危机信号基础上叠加了新的危机信号，本身就在提示“你的危机加深了”。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以“责备冷漠自私”反而会导致ta把骷髅剑握得更紧，很可能变得更冷漠自私。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对应的，要缓解这问题，就要对付这几个要素——", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要么，你要开始教授关于老工具的更深入的用法或者引入新工具。这个靠你自己的学习、积累和教学，我的内容里有大量这类内容。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "要么你就要避免让ta认为自己处在致命的困境中，避免ta觉得现在的工具不够用，尤其要避免ta在致命困境中感觉情况毫无希望、单线下滑。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个则主要靠两点——", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "第一点是客观的发现积极要素的眼光。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这不是靠自己编织美好设想，而是从仪表上看到实在的度数、在雷达上看到回波、在光谱图上看到尖峰，是用客观方法严谨测量的结果。积极效应也不是简单的“体验、直觉会好”，更不是“我打赌会好”“我保证会好”，而是有严谨的实验数据、历史参考，“历史记录显示同类情况下上涨概率为86%”“历史同期晴天概率95%”。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "靠训练有素的、近乎科学测量的手段确定结论，而不是一时疲乏就过度悲观往坏里猜、也不因一时兴奋而往好里猜。", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "第二点的是靠信仰。不管你是信仰天道还是轮回还是报应还是真主上帝佛陀，人可以靠信仰相信“在逆境中拒绝拿起骷髅剑本身可以带来好运”。", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "没什么别的聪明策略，纯靠我到这一步也可以忍住不伸手，天道就必然在我这边，我就有理由期盼会发生对我有利的意外事件，我就不必着急，可以继续坚持正确的努力。", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "更何况，在顺境中不拔骷髅剑有什么难的？恰恰是在逆境、困境中坚守不拔，才让“不向恶”有真实的意义。否则一旦遇到逆境困境就玩花的，这种脆弱的东西谈什么品格、气节？", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 1007}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "及时加强这几方面的建设，才是避免子女轻易拿起骷髅剑的有效手段。", "char_start": 1008, "char_end": 1039}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "冷漠自私，只是十二把骷髅剑里最轻的两把而已。", "char_start": 1040, "char_end": 1062}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：儿子考上985，却越来越冷漠自私了怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“骷髅剑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“冷漠自私也是人应对问题的一种手段，一种摆在桌面上唾手可得、有一定效果的手段。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "冷漠自私也是人应对问题的一种手段，一种摆在桌面上唾手可得、有一定效果的手段。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d73bc795-3d6c-5012-9883-5ce031b22ed4", "source_ordinal": 952, "reading_ordinal": 3105, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "高呼尊号", "published_at": "2025-02-13T23:28:25.068000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/323184485/answer/100328387666"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个称号的门道很有意思，可以说一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "它分为三类信息：", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）对应的传说你估计知道，但是你还不知道本人长啥样，现在我告诉你。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这包括了“风暴降生”“龙之母”“不焚者”“解放者”。你以前光听说这些歌谣传奇，你还不知道主人公长什么样，现在我提前预告一下给你，免得你错过机会。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "2）你应该知道、不知道的话可能因失礼而倒霉、所以我现在得要告诉你的事实信息。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这包括了“大草原上的卡丽熙”“弥林女王”。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个不是自封的，而是客观事实，帮助你正确认识你和ta的实力差距，让你知道自己几斤、对方几两，免得你发生误判。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "3）我自己宣告的自我认同，你如果承认会得到奖赏、如果不承认会受到惩罚和报复。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这包括了“铁王座的继承人”“安达尔人和先民的合法女王”“七国守护者”。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这是我自封、是我宣告的目标。如果你按照这个宣告来对待我，你就是我的朋友，反之你就是我的敌人。如果你两者都不想做，那么你提前做好准备，莫要近前来。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这三类信息都是为了帮助在场的人以正确的态度和礼仪来对待称号的主人。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "之所以如此，是因为其人身边有一股强大的力量会根据这个规格来审查你的礼仪，如果你不谨守，就等于对这力量宣战，那就看你能不能取胜，因为你如果战败，是会被处以严厉的刑罚的——可能会死。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "谁在宣告，就意味着谁是这护卫的力量——如果是该场合的东道主所安排的礼仪官宣告的，意味着东道主要求客人按照这个礼仪规格来对待此人。你如果不以对应礼仪应对，那么在面对此人的护卫力量之前，先要面对主人的报复和惩罚。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种宣告之所以听上去庄严尊贵，不在于其文字本身的气势，而是其背后由有组织暴力保证的“怠慢者罚、失礼者罪、挑衅者死”的威慑。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "挑衅这个称号，就是对所有认同这些称呼的人群的直接冒犯，那是要见生死的，这可绝不是好玩的事。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以要模仿这种尊号，你身后必须有一群死士，会无视任何其它法律契约，对敢于挑衅者实施残酷的报复。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "在这个前提下，你再补全上述三类信息，反而会构成对在场各人的一种慈悲——好心提醒，免得哪位莫名其妙的犯下死罪、身首异处。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 845}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以，本质上这不是在炫耀自己的高贵出身，而是在炫耀自己有死士追随。高贵是从死士追随上来的，不是从自我感觉良好上来的。", "char_start": 846, "char_end": 904}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何取个和龙母一样酷炫的外号?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“高呼尊号”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个称号的门道很有意思，可以说一下。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个称号的门道很有意思，可以说一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "15d53474-8bf6-5879-8209-cb5cdc17cb94", "source_ordinal": 951, "reading_ordinal": 3106, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不带夸赞的礼遇", "published_at": "2025-02-14T01:55:04.748000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/9bde0fa8ea3311ef8ab552540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你的委屈主要是因为你的心理上还是一个小孩。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "成年人的鄙视 / 尊崇链不是这么工作的。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "成年人并不会大肆夸赞那些无声的完成自己的本职工作的人，因为这的确只是成年人的及格线。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是这种无显性夸赞的态度，却不是一个无感的态度，而是会包含一个成年人对另一个成年人的高度的敬重。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只要对方和你有任何合作，哪怕其程度仅限于在你开的便利店里经常买几包烟、经常碰到你送ta家的快递、请你上门安装了一幅窗帘、修了一个马桶……只要你做到了准时准点、无惊无险、稳稳当当、符合质量要求——简而言之，达到了ta最通常的诉求——ta就会给你一个成年人对另一个成年人的正常待遇。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个待遇看上去仅限于一般性的礼貌、平和的对话、很普通的友善的态度、力所能及的成人之美，但实际上这个待遇会让儿童可望而不可及。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "例如，子女对这样的人无礼，父母会立刻道歉并感到是自己没尽到教育责任。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "例如，如果这样的人的陈述和子女的陈述发生了冲突，父母很可能倾向于认为对方说的是事实而子女可能搞不清状况。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如，在父母与这样的人对话期间小孩插嘴，父母会援引“大人说话小孩别插嘴”条款，给予对方优先待遇。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "例如，如果小孩在背后吐槽这样的人，父母可能会给予惩戒。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为父母自己就经历过大量“历经了难为外人道的痛苦和艰难，才勉强做到了没迟到 / 客户没发现问题 / 及时交付 / 正常交接 / 会议如期举行 / 顾客没投诉 ……”这类体验。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "父母深深的知道，别看这个服务如此的普通，但面前这位以标准水平提供标准服务的窗帘匠、油漆工、快递员、空调工、超市小老板、餐厅前台、清洁工、行政前台、会计、司机……都是顶住了千奇百怪、难为外人道的无常和风险才做到的。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "就像ta们在自己的岗位上顶住的那无数的变数和难以穷尽的心魔才勉强做到了没有突然抑郁大爆发连续迟到缺勤被开除那样，每一个在你面前不动声色、面带微笑、专业而熟练的完成了看上去没有任何值得特别夸赞之处的最普通的服务，而且自己也觉得这完全是份内事、没什么值得夸赞的成年人，在ta们眼里，都是战胜了整个世界——或者至少，还没有被这个世界打败——的英雄。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这就是所谓的“大家都不容易”。", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个成就就是每一个能在社会上稳稳立足，能不以恶为业养活自己的人的及格成就。确实只是及格而已，确实没什么可夸耀的。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 947}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但是，只有自己历经风雨劫难、挺住了无数心魔诱惑恐吓也同样站住了的人，才知道这“一点都不值得特别夸奖”的水平已经有多么艰难。", "char_start": 948, "char_end": 1009}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "以至于ta们会对同样闯过了这十八铜人阵的师兄弟拱手为礼。", "char_start": 1010, "char_end": 1038}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而很自然的，觉得自己做到了这么一件事世界就欠自己一个夸赞的人，显然还没资格享受这个礼遇。", "char_start": 1039, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你要这个夸赞，你就会失去这个不含夸赞的礼遇。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为能享受这个礼遇的人，把按质按量完成自己的分内事、完成自己的承诺视为一种不需要被夸赞、甚至没必要被感激、没必要被记录的平凡事——无论ta们自己为此经历了怎样的艰辛和折磨。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1193}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "ta们最享受的不是对方盛赞“这么大的雪，我都不抱希望了，你居然能准时把这件东西送到而且毫发无损”，而是在对方夸了这句之后，自己淡然一笑——“这本来就是应该的”。", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1274}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这句“应该的”，就是人类对这个世界最响亮、最自豪的胜利宣言。", "char_start": 1275, "char_end": 1305}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "heading", "index": 24, "text": "我定胜天，所以“应该”。", "char_start": 1306, "char_end": 1318}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你可能会愤愤不平——“其实我也只是要人家说前半句。ta们说了前半句，我也会说后半句”。", "char_start": 1320, "char_end": 1363}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但这里恰恰是你修炼未足的地方——成年人不需要人说那前半句，ta们的后半句不需要前半句。", "char_start": 1364, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "ta们不需要人恩赐这张梯子。", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1422}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你现在要这个夸赞，是因为你还体会不到这份不含夸赞的礼遇的贵重。", "char_start": 1423, "char_end": 1454}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "等你有一天也到这个境界了，你就会知道其实以抛弃这个夸赞为代价去换这个资格，才是一本万利。", "char_start": 1455, "char_end": 1499}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因为这就是你心心念念的那个所谓的尊重。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1519}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：辅导员让我订蛋糕，16 寸蛋糕一个人从蛋糕店运到会议室，没有表扬，有点委屈怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“不带夸赞的礼遇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你的委屈主要是因为你的心理上还是一个小孩。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你的委屈主要是因为你的心理上还是一个小孩。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b0d184b7-7ca9-5cab-885f-cc3e136c078f", "source_ordinal": 950, "reading_ordinal": 3107, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "衣甲精洁", "published_at": "2025-02-14T11:47:13.298000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/acb09736ea8511efa9f052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "衣物分内外衣，其中内衣是非常勤更换的，所以保持整洁的压力不大。而外衣分为礼服和常服，这其中常服主要指工作服、作训服，礼服则是指西装、大衣这一类。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "相对而言，常服用的是不太名贵且耐搓洗磨损的面料，往往也有多重走线、局部加强这些手段来提高耐用性，一般可以粗暴洗涤，维护挑战不大。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正特别需要保护的是面料昂贵、清洗复杂、熨烫维护需求麻烦的礼服外套。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以，这里只谈礼服外套的整洁维护问题。这些原则你当然也可以用在其他外套的维护上，这就靠你自己举一反三了。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）防止外套和身体接触。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这听上去很荒唐，但其实是第一要害，而且服装的设计天然的已经考虑了这一点——为什么西装需要配衬衫？衬衫的衬是在衬什么？就是在衬住身体，隔绝礼服与身体的直接接触。不信你仔细观察，何以衬衫袖口要超出西装袖口，衬衫领要高于西装领？正是因为要杜绝西装袖口摩擦到人的手腕、避免西装领口触及人的后颈。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为一旦接触，人体天然分泌的油脂就会沾染到礼服上，导致礼服的面料受损、需要被高频的清洁。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而礼服往往是不能局部强化清洁的——单独清洗沾染油脂的领口袖口，会导致这几处的布料迅速毛边、脱色，严重的损害礼服的品质。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "既然衬衫已经如此设计，自然也意味着你最好不要用手指、手掌去轻易清洁衣服上偶然沾染的小灰尘毛发。", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你时刻要有“皮肤含油”的意识，要像“手指上有石油”一样去警惕手指直接接触面料。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这也是为什么严谨的管家、侍从需要戴白手套，因为他们经常需要协助没有戴手套、不便直接接触衣服的主人穿脱礼服。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一件真正的好衣服是大师杰作，是作者有限的职业生涯里历历可数的作品之一，往往是孤品宝物，即使是国王公爵也是浪费不起的。而它们的面料配饰往往非常极端而完美，稍有损伤就会极大的损害其完美灿烂的外表。直接用含有油脂的皮肤去接触面料，堪称一种事故。如果竟然是毫无意识，毫无顾忌的频繁的徒手穿脱——这么说吧，顶级大师是根本不会卖给你的。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "事实上，很多华服都是根本不卖的，而是你要登基、结婚、开幕、会见，由大师临时借你穿，穿完就还回来了——人家只是要一张照片好摆在博物馆橱窗里，为这件作品增加历史价值。", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 875}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果这期间有人在面料上留下了油脂，这衣服摆在橱窗里久了，这最初肉眼难见的油脂随着时间迁移会越来越深的损害面料的色泽和材质。", "char_start": 876, "char_end": 937}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以，虽然这些礼服穿在人身上，但是强烈的“不可接触面料”的本能意识会是配穿、常穿它们的人的下意识习惯、生活常识。", "char_start": 938, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这也是为什么王公贵族们必须要有人伺候穿衣的原因——这不是因为要摆派头，而是当这些王公贵族开始享用这些代价高昂的华服后不得不做的适应——因为这些衣服贵到对国库都有负担，ta们也怠慢不起。", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1087}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "有时候ta们穷起来了，还指着拍卖这些衣服救急呢。", "char_start": 1088, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而由此就造成了一种“贵族范”——其实是这种迫不得已，逼得贵族们穿衣服会衬套俱全，甚至领、袖部位为了保持完美，不得不单独做假领、袖片来跟衣服搭配。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1185}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对应的——为什么下臣朝觐要吻手、吻戒指甚至拖鞋，为什么不能吻衣袖、下摆？", "char_start": 1186, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为衣服太贵，不可接触。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1235}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "2）杜绝出汗。", "char_start": 1237, "char_end": 1244}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这个道理看似简单——连手都摸不得，何况你汗透重衣呢？", "char_start": 1245, "char_end": 1271}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这当然意味着穿着礼服绝不能剧烈运动。但这并不够——这还意味着你必须避免炎热的环境。", "char_start": 1272, "char_end": 1313}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这也是为什么沙龙、聚会都是“晚会”，几乎一定要在夜间举行——因为这时气温比较低，稍微跳跳节奏像散步的交谊舞，不至于问题太大。", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而之所以各位贵族小姐要这么袒胸露乳、裸露手臂，也和她们其它地方穿得实在太厚，不多留点散热面积会问题巨大有关。这某种程度上是没有空调和丝、绒礼服导致的必然技术性适应。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这也是为什么国王一定要造“夏宫”，乃至于像候鸟一样带着整个宫廷两季迁徙——否则穿着礼服交际来往实在太折磨人。", "char_start": 1460, "char_end": 1514}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "而这个态度延续到现代，就是西方（包括香港）甲级写字楼、顶级商场里夏天会把温度设得很低的原因——这是一个穿着礼服才会舒服、只穿短衣会觉得发寒的温度。这只是延续了贵族礼仪的传统。", "char_start": 1515, "char_end": 1602}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而从家宅到社交场地包括途中一直享有宜人的温度，这是“贵族生活”的一贯特性。", "char_start": 1603, "char_end": 1640}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "即使是中国，夏季御前会议也会在御书房摆上冰盆和冰镇酸梅汤帮助翎顶辉煌的官员们保持仪态。", "char_start": 1641, "char_end": 1684}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这意味着你要保持衣物的整洁，你就不要考虑在室外步行太远，也不能考虑去搭乘没有空调的车辆。", "char_start": 1685, "char_end": 1729}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "因为你不可以出汗。", "char_start": 1730, "char_end": 1739}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "3）要注重餐桌礼仪。", "char_start": 1741, "char_end": 1751}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "如果你打算简单一点，那就干脆把外套脱掉，找稳妥地方放好，只穿你脏得起的衣服吃饭。", "char_start": 1752, "char_end": 1792}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "否则，要么你就要严格的注重餐桌礼仪，要么你就戴餐巾围布，保护你的外套。", "char_start": 1793, "char_end": 1828}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "戴餐巾围布很直白，不再赘述，不清楚的自己找找相关资料去了解。", "char_start": 1829, "char_end": 1859}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "问题是，坦率讲戴餐巾往往是不方便的，尤其是很多时候就餐地点并不会提供餐巾，而这个场合也不适合脱外套吃饭，那么就要注意就餐的魔鬼细节：", "char_start": 1860, "char_end": 1926}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "a）身体前倾而不要后仰。如果你后仰，食物碎屑、汁水会很容易溅落胸口。如果你身体适当前倾，即使有意外掉落，也不会掉落到你的衣服上。", "char_start": 1927, "char_end": 1991}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "b）夹取、叉取食物要稳妥，防止意外掉落。所谓稳妥，不仅包括要拿稳，还包括要先把食物分割成可以一口吃的小块，不要叉子叉一大块叉着咬，否则弄得不好叉子上你没吃的部分意外脱落，就要造成灾难。", "char_start": 1992, "char_end": 2084}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "c）非必要不要把食物举得太高。举的越高，意外掉落的势能越大，落到桌面上弹跳溅射越远，造成的威胁越大。", "char_start": 2085, "char_end": 2135}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "d）食物下方的盘碗里不要有汁水积蓄。最致命的事故就是食物掉进汤水里导致汁水四溅。那几乎必然造成灾难。", "char_start": 2136, "char_end": 2186}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "e）不要勉强分割食物，以免滑刀导致食物飞出，造成污染事故。这也是为什么正式宴会的食物都要求软烂或者预先切割，这不是因为来宾牙口不好，而是为了避免造成尴尬事故。", "char_start": 2187, "char_end": 2266}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "f）饮食动作时不要说话大笑，容易咳呛造成事故。礼仪上也不宜讲过于幽默的笑话——要讲等吃完饭之后讲。", "char_start": 2267, "char_end": 2316}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "如果你顺着这条思路看下去，你就会理解大部分贵族的餐桌礼仪——这些规矩和习惯都和防止污染衣物有关。", "char_start": 2317, "char_end": 2365}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "4）注意环境安全。", "char_start": 2367, "char_end": 2376}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "举点例子，不要在污水横流的地方行走。这也是为什么贵族们常常从宫殿铺装地面一步就踏上马车或上马，而到了地方也有红毯相迎。这是为了避免衣物接触脏乱的地面，意外受损。", "char_start": 2377, "char_end": 2457}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "也是为什么身着华服不能进车间工坊。要去一定要换工装。", "char_start": 2458, "char_end": 2484}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "也是为什么打猎出游一定要换猎装、便装。", "char_start": 2485, "char_end": 2504}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "行走坐卧都要当心。", "char_start": 2505, "char_end": 2514}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "5）注意行为举止，防止伤害衣物状态。", "char_start": 2516, "char_end": 2534}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "最典型的就是坐下之前处理好下摆，防止把下摆坐皱。", "char_start": 2535, "char_end": 2559}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "也不勉强去做衣服剪裁不允许的大动作，以免损坏缝线等脆弱结构。", "char_start": 2560, "char_end": 2590}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "6）衣物保存要得当，防止衣物在保存时损坏。", "char_start": 2592, "char_end": 2613}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "这主要包括避光防止紫外线导致染料变色、织物变性，通风防潮防霉变、防虫蛀、防火烧、防干裂。", "char_start": 2614, "char_end": 2658}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "身上的金属件要防剥落、防氧化、防锈蚀。", "char_start": 2659, "char_end": 2678}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "但还有一样至关重要但一般人常常忽视的——防重力垂坠导致衣物变形。", "char_start": 2679, "char_end": 2711}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "解决这个问题，常常需要把不方便平铺保存的衣物——尤其是长外套——“穿”在带绒的模型身上。借助绒布的强大摩擦力，把下摆的巨大坠力分摊给整个胸、肩、领，而不是将所有的拉力都集中到肩顶、领口上。否则厚重衣料再加沉重配饰很可能会拉坏衣服。", "char_start": 2712, "char_end": 2827}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "而这所有的维护保养手段，都是为了一个关键目的——尽量减少外套的清洗必要，延长清洗周期。", "char_start": 2829, "char_end": 2872}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "因为每次清洗干燥都会对礼服有很大的伤害，尤其是发明化学干洗手段之前。", "char_start": 2873, "char_end": 2907}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "看上去“如何保持衣物的整洁”是一个“生活百科”类的小题目，但实际上这个“小问题”却深刻的影响到了人类的社会文化。", "char_start": 2909, "char_end": 2965}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "人类关于“高雅举止”“高贵气质”的基本认知，和贵族们习惯成自然的对极其高昂的礼装华服的无微不至的维护有巨大的关系。", "char_start": 2966, "char_end": 3023}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "这些衣服是这些贵族穿在身上的宫殿，甚至很多比ta们的房子还要华贵。而这些精美绝伦的世间孤品，和ta们的身份、地位、品位融为一体，是ta们身份认同不可分割的一部分。", "char_start": 3024, "char_end": 3105}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "可以这么说——器具、车马、居所的设计无不深刻的受到着ta们衣甲维护的需求影响。而这些影响最终在人类的下意识里直观的定义了“高贵”的概念。", "char_start": 3106, "char_end": 3174}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "一个深谙这些底层逻辑、隐秘需求的设计师只要一出手，贵人们就非常清楚这位设计师是不是“懂”。", "char_start": 3175, "char_end": 3220}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "这是一条隐秘的分界，仅仅只是从表面去模仿外在特征的人是把握不住的。", "char_start": 3221, "char_end": 3254}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "你要设计一颗扣子，这颗扣子到底是该镀镍、还是应该镀银、镀金，还是使用贝母、珍珠……这个材质选择就不是一个简单的美学问题，还是一个复杂的实用成本问题。", "char_start": 3255, "char_end": 3329}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "body", "index": 66, "text": "何以扣子往往用包金工艺，其实是因为扣子必然要和手指接触，必须用性质高度稳定的材料来制作。", "char_start": 3330, "char_end": 3374}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "body", "index": 67, "text": "而之所以猎装、骑装的罩衣披风要用束带而不是扣子来固定衣襟，是因为带着手套的手指处理不好扣扣子这样微妙的动作。", "char_start": 3375, "char_end": 3429}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "设计一个细节、一个特征，要想从骨子里抓住那个特质、那个精神意向，就必须潜入形塑那个意向的技术性、物理性的逻辑前提，首先理解那样的意向到底是被什么孕育出来的，理解转译出它的形貌的“基因”是什么，是循着什么机制建成了它们的传统。", "char_start": 3430, "char_end": 3542}, {"paragraph_id": "P069", "field": "body", "index": 69, "text": "只有先理解了从源头到现状的逻辑连线，才有可能沿着这自始至终的矢量箭头看向历史的去向，实现历史性的演进和超越。", "char_start": 3543, "char_end": 3597}, {"paragraph_id": "P070", "field": "body", "index": 70, "text": "这不是一个小题目。", "char_start": 3598, "char_end": 3607}, {"paragraph_id": "P071", "field": "body", "index": 71, "text": "这是一个大题目。", "char_start": 3608, "char_end": 3616}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 79}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何保持衣物的整洁？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068", "P069", "P070", "P071"], "summary": "围绕“衣甲精洁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“衣物分内外衣，其中内衣是非常勤更换的，所以保持整洁的压力不大。而外衣分为礼服和常服，这其中常服主要指工作服、作训服，礼服则是指西装、大衣这一类。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "衣物分内外衣，其中内衣是非常勤更换的，所以保持整洁的压力不大。而外衣分为礼服和常服，这其中常服主要指工作服、作训服，礼服则是指西装、大衣这一类。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "95829959-f721-5c68-a991-5a0a3afc76d7", "source_ordinal": 949, "reading_ordinal": 3108, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "外卖英豪", "published_at": "2025-02-14T20:40:39.875000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/392643496/answer/3493434979"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "外卖在某种意义上是一个“信用池”，并不是毫无积累的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "别的不说——能稳定的做好几年外卖，很能说明当事人以下几点：", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）有时间观念。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个显而易见。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "2）有效率意识。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个不言自明。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "3）有一定信用。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "大外卖企业也就这几家，是保留有你的工作记录的。你在天津跑完再去南昌接着跑，如果之前记录良好自然入职很顺利。如果有很大问题，最起码要换一家平台再跑了，这对人是一个很现实的损失。发生个一次两次，也很教育人了。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "更别说几万单能跑下来，没有很多投诉，这很客观的证明了一定的信用。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "4）灵活机智的工作方法。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "地形、交规、车况、订单情况是千奇百怪的，能把外卖跑顺、跑得有足够获得感以至于能长期坚持，没有一定的灵活性是办不到的。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "5）服务千奇百怪客户的强韧心态。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "外卖员无法选择客户，几年时间做几万单，那真是什么人都见识过了。能做下来意味着这些人都应付过去了，这本身就证明了一定的心理强度。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "见识社会百态并且幸存本身就是最好的社会教育，其实比心理治疗这些更坚实和有决定性。这本身就是一笔财富。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "6）勤劳勇敢、自食其力的基本品德。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个也不言而喻。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "外卖做几年下来，金钱收入只是一方面，在心态、信用方面其实也有一定的积累。这本身是一笔不小的财富。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "比如做过了外卖快递，劳动强度比这小得多的生意自然做起来心态上就很轻松，一些需要待人接物的服务行业做起来心态也会比较平和稳定，这都可以成为职业上的其他出路。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以综合来说，外卖并不是一个很差的职业选择。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "相比之下，流水线工作对后续的职业之路的长期帮助其实在一些方面是不如外卖的——最明显的就是流水线相对封闭，不是服务行业，没有形成社会经验和相应的心理资产。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "当然，中国制造业本身也在升级，尤其是在走向自己掌握品牌和市场销售的新阶段。这个阶段不像之前的简单单纯来料、来样加工，往往是有较为稳定的市场需求和精益求精的技术追求，这就对人员稳定性和人员的长期可塑性有更大的要求。这些有前途的工厂里有发展空间的职位是会慢慢增长的，但这就需要劳动者自己有足够的文化基础来满足这个需求。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "外卖自然显著的比纯体力的流水线有前途，但和有技术含量和市场份额的工厂相比则不好说了——未来电动汽车产业、航空产业也会拉动很大的就业。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 924}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这几年这些行业的从业人数几乎在以每年倍增的速度成长，2023年电动车行业已经150万人了，这些人几乎全是在机器人为主体的现代化制造业，前途自然也很光明。", "char_start": 925, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而汽车制造只是中国产业升级的一个方面而已。说白了工厂技术不升级、纯靠血汗和低价，在中国本身就没有前途了。你倒是肯血汗，问题是血汗就能做到我要的质量和工艺吗？恰恰相反，那些不得不忍受血汗代价的工人们往往无法理解新工艺的复杂要求，也做不出那么精密的结果，只能做没啥质量、没有什么独特性、也没有什么牌子可言的低值易耗品。这些东西会越来越不符合中国市场本身的需求，自然而然要移向越南孟加拉印度。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我们的制造业下一步要追求用机器人作出成本不比孟加拉、印度、越南高，品质和多样性却超出一个时代的产品。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1246}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "所以“宁可送外卖也不进工厂”本身恐怕在将来也不尽然。", "char_start": 1247, "char_end": 1273}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "总而言之，我们的未来是非常光明的，现在是美国在制造不确定性，但这是黎明前的黑暗。", "char_start": 1274, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这对各位年轻人来说并不是坏事——抓紧这些“没单子的寒冬期”好好的学习锻炼，积累一些真本事，身体练好，把心态理顺。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1371}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "未来几年我们的上坡路会越来越明显，自有你们吃肉的时候。", "char_start": 1372, "char_end": 1399}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0449"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么现在的年轻人宁愿去送外卖都不愿进工厂？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“外卖英豪”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“外卖在某种意义上是一个“信用池”，并不是毫无积累的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "外卖在某种意义上是一个“信用池”，并不是毫无积累的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
